{"script":"s_3_7_3","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"恩塔尔","text":"[show]吼吼吼，这你们可问对人了。我就是“捕蛇猎人”！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"恩塔尔","text":"[show]要对付这些狡猾的魔蛇，一定要好好准备手头上的装备。我正好有一个办法，那就是制作一个“蛇鳞刺盾”！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]什么玩意？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2n","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"恩塔尔","text":"[show]我曾经孤身一人深入了一座蛇窟！我每干掉一条魔爪蛇，就把它们坚硬的鳞片剐下来，插在我的盾牌上，让它们每咬上来一口都会付出血的代价！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"恩塔尔","text":"[show]每当干掉一条魔爪蛇，我就就地取材再制作一次，然后再用盾牌对付下一条！我就这么和那些蛇怪大战了三天三夜，直到把它们都清理干净！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哇哦，真的假的！好像听起来还很实用啊！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"恩塔尔","text":"[show]那是当然，我用这种方法对付它们很多次了！只要1个蛇鳞、1个木材、1个钉子，我来教你们制作！这样这样……那样那样……明白了吗！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唔……看起来也不复杂啊。好，我们知道了，非常感谢！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"恩塔尔","text":"[show]不客气，把那些蛇都干掉吧！吼吼吼！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para